; DREAD HARBINGER (design 1.3, rulings 8-9): one ATTACK POST crit reaction, automatic, 1/round as a
; trait, that Locks On the target of a crit by the Black Mountain or an allied character within its
; Sensors and line of sight, and hangs the VISIBLE mark buff_dread_harbinger_mark that pays 1d6
; Overshield when that lock is consumed. The Kit's effect row is the card; the reaction is drawn under
; its own name. SP3: one glyph family with the mark.
